WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:15,020
Question number one, the rife ball. Just want to confirm you leave it in the plastic tube if you don't take it out.

00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:28,020
Yes, don't take it out of the plastic tube. Absolutely, duct. You avoid the warranty and you'll be buying a new ball. So do not take it out of the plastic tube.

00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:30,020
Yes, correct.

00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:45,020
Please go to the member site. Look on the rife page. You'll see a whole bunch of the rife questions answered on there too. So make sure you're utilizing the member site the best you possibly can.

